      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Two Cottages. c.1.55 Acres. One Big Project.\r\n\r\nAt Ardlonan, Carlanstown, two semi-detached cottages are being sold together as one lot, set on c.1.55 acres.\r\nBoth cottages need a full overhaul. This is a project from the start, but one that gives the next owner the chance to rethink the space, bring the cottages back into use and shape the property to suit their plans.\r\n\r\nTo the rear is a range of sheds, while the c.1.55 acres gives good ground around the cottages and outbuildings.\r\n\r\nThe location is a big part of the draw. Carlanstown, Kells and Navan are all within easy reach, with the N52 close by giving good access to the main road network.\r\n\r\nThe current state of the cottages may open the door to the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant and other grant aid, subject to the rules and terms that apply.\r\n\r\nTwo cottages. Sheds. c.1.55 acres. A good location with plenty of scope.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n- Two semi-detached cottages sold together as one lot\r\n- Set on c.1.55 acres\r\n- Full renovation needed\r\n- Range of sheds to the rear\r\n- Scope to renovate and rework, subject to any consents needed\r\n- Grant potential, subject to criteria\r\n- Close to the N52\r\n- Well placed for Carlanstown, Kells and Navan\r\n- Eircode A82 RR70"
      },
      {
